                <pb facs="0625" n="541" sameAs="frus:frus1886/pg541"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Decree of April</hi> 30, 1869.</head>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Article</hi> 1. After the 1st of June, 1869, no
                    vessel can be cleared for one of the ports of the Republic if all the duties,
                    importation as well as exportation, have not been entirely paid.</p>
            </div>
